8","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120657","id":4813051218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHuFVUg","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-26T20:05:18Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T20:05:18Z","body":"> The new has a circle inside a rectangle, so what does the circle represent?\r\n\r\nIt's a small rectangle, but it looks like a circle due to the rounded corners. Unfortunately, it's not possible to make it have a non-square aspect ratio due to the limited space.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4813051218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4816004704","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120657#issuecomment-4816004704","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120657","id":4816004704,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHw5mYA","user":{"login":"Zi