com/users/aXu-AP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aXu-AP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aXu-AP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aXu-AP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aXu-AP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aXu-AP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aXu-AP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aXu-AP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-27T10:28:58Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T10:28:58Z","body":"I think this highlights why coming up with a robust set of guidelines for icons are needed (as stated in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15077). If it isn't possible to make as simple icon as a rectangle inside another, the constraints are a bit too much. In this case, having 14x14 px space with 2 pixel wide lines/negative space (resulting essentially 7x7 grid for the icon) is super restrictive.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4816750407/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]